Layer Caching in Real CI/CD
Imagine GitHub Actions.
Every commit:
git push
   ↓
CI
   ↓
docker build
Without good caching:
Every build
 ↓
Install all dependencies
 ↓
Build everything
Slow.
With proper Dockerfile structure and build caching:
Commit
 ↓
docker build
 ↓
Reuse unchanged layers
 ↓
Build only changed layers
CI/CD becomes much faster.
